{
  "name": "dsh-highlight-plugin",
  "version": "1.2.8",
  "description": "会话内划重点：在 DSH 会话界面上选中任意语句，一键标成高亮色块（黄/绿/蓝）；同句重标=替换不叠色；端点支持元素容器（加粗/标题/段首起拖也能标）；色块用独立覆盖层绘制（不碰框架 React 管的 DOM，重渲染冲不掉）；点色块弹删除确认，叠在一起的多条可一键全删；标记按会话存盘（~/.dsh/highlights/<会话id>.json），会话持续期间一直在，跨重启也在，直到手动删除",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "smoke.mjs",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-session-controller",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "smoke": "node smoke.mjs"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
